%%{init: {"fontSize": 14, "themeVariables": {"fontSize": "14px"}, "sequence": {"actorMargin": 24, "messageMargin": 30, "noteMargin": 6, "width": 140, "wrap": true}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    box PUBLIC ZONE
        participant RS as Routing Service<br>trade-imports-<br>routing-proxy
        participant JF as Journey Frontend<br>trade-imports-<br>{journey}-frontend
    end
    box PROTECTED ZONE
        participant SS as Session Service
        participant JB as Journey Backend<br>trade-imports-<br>{journey}-backend
        participant PS as Permissions Service
    end

    B->>RS: GET /gbn-ag/documents/456/scan-status<br>session cookie
    RS->>JF: GET /documents/456/scan-status<br>X-Forwarded-Prefix: /gbn-ag,<br>session cookie
    Note over JF: Sealed cookie value read<br>from the cookie
    JF->>SS: GET /sessions/assertion<br>Ins-Session-Token, Sec-Fetch-*,<br>Ins-Browser-Accept
    Note over SS: Script call recognised,<br>lastSeenAt not written
    SS-->>JF: 200 csrfSecret,<br>session assertion
    Note over JF: Read only, so no<br>anti-forgery check,<br>checked if the call<br>changes data
    JF->>JB: GET /documents/456/scan-status<br>Ins-Session-Assertion
    Note over JB: Assertion signature,<br>audience, expiry checked
    JB->>PS: POST /permissions/expansions<br>roles
    PS-->>JB: 200 permissions
    JB-->>JF: 200 scan status
    JF-->>B: 200 scan status
